<!--
  Settings of the KiteVault autofill service (read by Android).
  - No <compatibility-package>: Android's "compatibility mode" (reading other apps through the
    accessibility system) is deliberately NOT used. Chrome stopped supporting it, and it makes
    the web address of a page much harder to trust.
  - No settingsActivity yet: the Autofill screen inside KiteVault is the settings page.
-->
